      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 213 Castlecurragh Vale, a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached family home ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Castlecurragh development. Perfectly located in the heart of Dublin 15, this property enjoys an unbeatable setting just minutes from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and the Blanchardstown Centre Retail Park, with an excellent selection of shops, restaurants, cafés and leisure facilities close at hand. A host of local schools, parks, sporting clubs and everyday amenities are all within easy reach, while excellent public transport links and immediate access to the N3 and M50 make commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond both quick and convenient.\nExtending to approximately 85 sq.m, this bright and well-proportioned home offers excellent living accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious front living room, a guest WC and a generous open-plan kitchen/dining area overlooking the rear garden. Upstairs boasts three well-proportioned bedrooms and a fully fitted family bathroom. To the rear, a sunny, low-maintenance garden with valuable side access provides the perfect space for outdoor dining, entertaining or family enjoyment. Communal parking is conveniently located to the front.\nNo. 213 comes to the market offering a fantastic opportunity for its next owner to modernise and add their own personal touch. Whether you're a first-time buyer searching for your forever home, a growing family looking for additional space or an investor seeking a property in a consistently strong rental location, this home is sure to impress.\n\nFeatures;\n<ul>\n <li>3 BED / 2 BATH family home</li>\n <li>Semi-Detached</li>\n <li>85 sq m</li>\n <li>Sunny rear garden with side entrance</li>\n <li>Spacious living room</li>\n <li>Open-plan kitchen and dining area</li>\n <li>Guest WC on ground floor</li>\n <li>Three generous bedrooms</li>\n <li>Communal parking to the front</li>\n <li>Quiet, family-friendly residential development</li>\n <li>Excellent potential to modernise and add value</li>\n <li>Minutes from Blanchardstown Shopping Centre</li>\n <li>Walking distance to schools, parks and local amenities</li>\n <li>Excellent transport links with easy access to the N3, M50 and Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors alike</li>\n <li>Early viewing is highly recommended</li>\n</ul>\n\nDirections:\n\nEircode = D15 W6E5"
      },
      {
